<mxCell id="s342" value="Store indexes (values cannot say which copy or how far). Each index is pushed once and popped at most once → O(n) time, O(n) memory; the nested scan is O(n²)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="438" width="820" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
